## Integration acceptance

- Check that view and edit modes cannot confuse navigation, configuration changes and device actions.
- Try missing targets, invalid configuration, unsaved edits and theme switching. Saved card data must not change.
- Record the keyboard move and resize result for the installed frontend, and any native limit you could not resolve.

Record what was tested using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). A source review or a local example is not a live check.

Wording follows [Separate state from action](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html#wg-031), [Keep saved, enabled and running apart](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html#wg-035), [Say what Cancel, Stop and Delete do](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html#wg-036) and [Make results reach assistive technology](../content/formatting-content/text-formatting.html#wg-084).
